      "blocks": {
        "faq_free": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Is it really free to join?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The Basic tier is completely free with no commitment. You get 3% cashback and 1 raffle ticket per month from your very first order. As your lifetime spend grows, you automatically unlock higher tiers with better rewards — no action needed.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true
          }
        },
        "faq_cashback": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How does cashback work?",
            "content": "<p>Every purchase earns cashback at your tier rate (3% to 12%). The cashback is automatically credited to your account as store credit. You can apply it to any future order at checkout — there are no restrictions on which products you can use it on, and it never expires.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_tiers": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How do I move up tiers?",
            "content": "<p>Tiers are based on your lifetime spend. Once you reach £500 in total purchases, you automatically unlock SR (5% cashback). At £800, you reach SSR (8% cashback). Tier upgrades are permanent — you never drop back down. Premium (12%) will be available as an annual subscription for £58/year.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_raffle": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What are mystery pack raffles?",
            "content": "<p>Each month, we run a raffle exclusively for members. Your tier determines how many tickets you receive (1 to 8 per month). Winners receive a mystery pack containing alternative art cards, high-value collectibles, or jackpot rewards. Prizes are sourced from our own inventory and are worth significantly more than any membership cost.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "faq_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do members get free shipping?",
            "content": "<p>All customers get free UK shipping on orders over £80. Membership cashback can be combined with free shipping — so on a £80 order at the SR tier, you would get £4 back in cashback plus free delivery. International shipping rates apply as normal.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
